PDO_MYSQL: the MySQL driver of PDO, through mysqlnd. With php56-mysqlnd;
php56-pdo_mysql-openssl is the same for php56-mysqlnd-openssl.

The module pdo_mysql of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/pdo_mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/pdo_mysql.
